# FRACTINT |   Angle 20
# FRACTINT |   Axiom [x]++++[x]++++[x]++++[x]++++[x]
# FRACTINT |   x=@.618034++g[@1.1755-------f][|y]----g[|x]
# FRACTINT |   x=[|++@.618034g@i.618034x]------[x]g----[y]g
