let ANGLE = 18;

axiom [ X ] Plus Plus Plus Plus [ X ] Plus Plus Plus Plus [ X ] Plus Plus Plus Plus [ X ] Plus Plus Plus Plus [ X ];

match X then Scale(0.618034) Plus Plus G [ Scale(1.1755) Minus Minus Minus Minus Minus Minus Minus F ] [ TurnAround Y ] Minus Minus Minus Minus G [ TurnAround X ] [ TurnAround Plus Plus Scale(0.618034) G Scale(1.6180339593) X ] Minus Minus Minus Minus Minus Minus [ X ] G Minus Minus Minus Minus [ Y ] G;
match Y then Scale(0.618034) Plus Plus Plus Plus [ X ] G TurnAround Plus Plus G [ TurnAround Y ] Minus Minus [ Y ] G TurnAround Plus Plus G [ TurnAround X ];
match F then G;
